<title>POLAND: Budimex wins $9 million contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex wins $9 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA has signed a contract with  Coca Cola Poland Ltd worth $9 million for work on a plant in Radzymin, central Poland, Budimex said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The project must be completed by May 1, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
